5
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪ The furnace refines the empty void ♪

6
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,906
♪ The Way is in mystic fate ♪

7
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪ Be brave enough to split the primal chaos wide open ♪

8
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,596
[Pull Strings]

9
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,500
[Adapted from the novel by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

10
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:43,180
[Eve of Li Changshou's Tribulation]

11
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,330
So many clouds up here.

12
00:01:50,310 --> 00:01:51,660
That is...

13
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,400
Changgeng?

14
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,660
No wonder Fate didn't strike me down.

15
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,130
He's a ruthless one.

16
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,400
Bear with it a moment.

17
00:02:12,750 --> 00:02:13,780
The Pregenesis Sword.

18
00:02:22,460 --> 00:02:25,420
[Episode 16]

19
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,220
This Tribulation bearer

20
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,940
looks like Changgeng.

21
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,450
Changgeng is but a mask.

22
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:40,940
No wonder we couldn't find him.

23
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:44,260
Did you see his face?

24
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,126
That was the Divine-Demon Tribulation.

25
00:02:46,150 --> 00:02:47,096
I couldn't get anywhere near it.

26
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,340
But I saw Changgeng

27
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,060
take out the Pregenesis Sword.

28
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,780
After he left Bear Island,

29
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,480
he went straight into the Tribulation.

30
00:02:54,150 --> 00:02:55,870
So, he must've gotten the magic instrument.

31
00:02:56,590 --> 00:02:58,260
That's why his power surged.

32
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,936
Now that he's survived the Tribulation,

33
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,126
his power must've grown enormously.

34
00:03:01,150 --> 00:03:02,380
If we don't deal with him now,

35
00:03:02,470 --> 00:03:03,166
sooner or later,

36
00:03:03,190 --> 00:03:05,536
he'll be a grave threat to the Westdawn Sect.

37
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,850
More importantly,

38
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:10,570
we must take the Pregenesis Sword from him.

39
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,730
The Westdawn Sect's plan spans a thousand years.

40
00:03:14,910 --> 00:03:17,980
The Two Saints await us to open the East Sea's Eye.

41
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,540
Easier said than done.

42
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,850
Where can we find his true form?

43
00:03:27,630 --> 00:03:29,380
Changgeng first appeared

44
00:03:29,630 --> 00:03:31,260
in the Dragon Palace of the East Sea.

45
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:34,380
There was only one route in and out.

46
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:35,960
That means.

47
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:38,060
Changgeng's true form

48
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:40,980
was among those in the palace then.

49
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,540
If he's not from the Dragon Clan,

50
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:45,730
he must be from the Ascendance Sect.

51
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,216
Changgeng is a fearsome foe,

52
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,940
but he has things he fears.

53
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,690
He used this mask

54
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:54,940
to keep us from finding his true form.

55
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,800
Then,

56
00:03:57,750 --> 00:03:59,500
there must be a reason.

57
00:03:59,710 --> 00:04:01,980
We'll expose what he fears

58
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,660
and force a flaw to show.

59
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:06,510
How do you plan to do that?

60
00:04:07,750 --> 00:04:08,750
Lord Bian,

61
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:12,540
you might reveal his mask

62
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:15,100
and tell everyone

63
00:04:15,150 --> 00:04:17,580
that the cultivator who survived

64
00:04:18,510 --> 00:04:20,190
the Divine-Demon Tribulation is Changgeng.

65
00:04:23,270 --> 00:04:24,270
What do you mean?

66
00:04:27,790 --> 00:04:28,790
Next,

67
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:33,980
point Changgeng's identity toward the Ascendance Sect.

68
00:04:36,110 --> 00:04:37,140
Wen Jing,

69
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,900
you asked me for a plan.

70
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,460
It's time to set it in motion.

71
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:47,300
Are you sure?

72
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:49,370
The Westdawn Sect's thousand-year plan

73
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,570
is just one step away.

74
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,370
We must find Changgeng

75
00:04:56,510 --> 00:04:57,900
and seize the Pregenesis Sword,

76
00:04:58,630 --> 00:05:00,660
no matter the cost.

77
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:08,340
[Anshui City, Donglin Kingdom]

78
00:05:08,390 --> 00:05:10,140
The Sea Deity

79
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:11,850
can grant great power!

80
00:05:12,430 --> 00:05:13,660
If you want it,

81
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:16,780
come and find Xiong Lingli.

82
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,486
The Sea Deity

83
00:05:18,510 --> 00:05:19,780
can grant great power!

84
00:05:19,870 --> 00:05:20,976
If you want it,

85
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,576
come and find Xiong Lingli.

86
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,606
Take a look at the Sea Deity Sect.

87
00:05:23,630 --> 00:05:24,630
The Sea Deity Sect.

88
00:05:25,630 --> 00:05:27,336
Come and find Xiong Lingli.

89
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,366
The Sea Deity can grant great power!

90
00:05:29,390 --> 00:05:32,610
If you want it, come and find Xiong Lingli.

91
00:05:37,780 --> 00:05:39,260
[The Sea Deity can grant great power]

92
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,930
Sir, do you want in?

93
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:44,070
The Sea Deity Sect?

94
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,850
The Sea Deity can grant great power!

95
00:05:46,750 --> 00:05:48,050
Bro, join us.

96
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:52,536
Our Grandlord Changgeng

97
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,926
is a true deity.

98
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:54,950
Changgeng?

99
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:56,456
Could it be the Changgeng

100
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,290
who faced Tribulation in the South Sea?

101
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:00,540
You know our deity?

102
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:03,576
A deity's Tribulation is rare.

103
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,536
Word has spread these days.

104
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:07,660
I heard that Changgeng

105
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:10,020
is a Qi refiner from Ascendance Sect.

106
00:06:11,270 --> 00:06:12,930
Do you know the way to Ascendance Sect?

107
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,250
It's in the Divine Land.

108
00:06:16,870 --> 00:06:18,020
Everyone, follow me.

109
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:19,776
Everyone, hurry, follow me!

110
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,166
I've found the deity!

111
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:21,696
The Sea Deity...

112
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,696
Deity, I'm coming!

113
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,776
Can grant great power!

114
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,726
Deity!

115
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:25,486
The Sea Deity...

116
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:26,486
Deity, I'm coming!

117
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:27,536
Can grant great power!

118
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,780
Deity!

119
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:39,540
[Good Luck, Certain Victory]

120
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:46,260
This Tribulation is too showy.

121
00:06:46,670 --> 00:06:49,050
It will surely spark new karma

122
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:51,700
and bring even more calamity.

123
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:54,810
I must account for every change.

124
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,326
With your skill,

125
00:06:57,350 --> 00:06:58,570
why hide yourself away?

126
00:06:58,830 --> 00:07:00,100
You could show your talent

127
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:02,060
and make your name among cultivators.

128
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:03,740
That will not do.

129
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,056
The Great Tribulation

130
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,366
is almost upon us.

131
00:07:07,390 --> 00:07:10,220
I cannot be noticed now.

132
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,450
The Westdawn Sect is after me.

133
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:18,496
My paper butterflies found

134
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,760
that someone has spread rumors,

135
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:22,050
claiming Changgeng caused this Tribulation,

136
00:07:22,350 --> 00:07:23,350
and that Changgeng

137
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,140
is hiding in Ascendance Sect.

138
00:07:25,430 --> 00:07:26,430
Good.

139
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,640
Good?

140
00:07:27,750 --> 00:07:29,220
How is that good?

141
00:07:30,470 --> 00:07:31,650
Back on Bear Island,

142
00:07:32,070 --> 00:07:33,540
you helped me plan.

143
00:07:34,350 --> 00:07:35,540
Now, it's my turn.

144
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:42,140
Yunxiao, any plan?

145
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:43,536
It's quite simple.

146
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:46,050
You only need to admit that you're Changgeng.

147
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:48,890
Westdawn Sect hides in the dark.

148
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,056
If we can't catch them,

149
00:07:50,080 --> 00:07:51,730
we'll stay on the back foot.

150
00:07:52,110 --> 00:07:53,496
Now, they have recognized you.

151
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:54,776
Just claim your identity.

152
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,300
That will bring them out.

153
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,360
Rest assured.

154
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:58,446
With my help,

155
00:07:58,470 --> 00:07:59,730
I will keep you safe.

156
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,136
Once we catch a Westdawn Sect man,

157
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,500
we can trace the clue

158
00:08:03,550 --> 00:08:04,726
and bring down Westdawn Sect.

159
00:08:04,750 --> 00:08:06,730
Then we can stop the Great Tribulation.

160
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:07,960
Yunxiao.

161
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:08,810
Well.

162
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:10,860
Have you misunderstood me?

163
00:08:11,630 --> 00:08:12,366
What?

164
00:08:12,390 --> 00:08:14,730
I can't claim that identity.

165
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:15,650
You...

166
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,086
I've arranged the Dragon Clan's ascension plan

167
00:08:17,110 --> 00:08:19,136
for the Celestial Court.

168
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,006
But I accidentally

169
00:08:20,030 --> 00:08:22,810
stripped Ao Yi of all his spiritual energy.

170
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:24,776
So, I must help him regain his strength

171
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,726
and return to the Dragon Palace,

172
00:08:25,750 --> 00:08:27,646
so I can finish the ascension plan.

173
00:08:27,670 --> 00:08:28,776
What about the Westdawn Sect?

174
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,496
They're triggering the Great Tribulation,

175
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:32,610
yet you're focused on your ascension plan.

176
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,300
Right now,

177
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:37,086
the best outcome is letting the Celestial Court

178
00:08:37,110 --> 00:08:38,730
step into Dragon Palace affairs.

179
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:41,250
Yunxiao, don't be so hasty.

180
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:43,890
I am being hasty.

181
00:08:44,110 --> 00:08:45,500
You leave nothing to chance.

182
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,240
Yunxiao.

183
00:08:48,550 --> 00:08:49,550
Yunxiao.

184
00:08:50,110 --> 00:08:51,416
We still do not know

185
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,326
how far Westdawn Sect has spread.

186
00:08:52,350 --> 00:08:53,726
So we cannot act rashly.

187
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:54,766
Did you not say they've infiltrated

188
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:56,136
the Ascendance Sect?

189
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,926
Let's just start with Ascendance Sect

190
00:08:57,950 --> 00:09:00,256
and root out Westdawn Sect entirely.

191
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:01,976
You make it sound so easy.

192
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,326
But...

193
00:09:02,350 --> 00:09:03,350
You are unwilling?

194
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,140
It is not that.

195
00:09:07,350 --> 00:09:08,350
This matter

196
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,100
needs a longer plan

197
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,420
and full preparation, right?

198
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,580
Then, you can

199
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,120
take your time preparing.

200
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:19,280
Yunxiao.

201
00:09:19,510 --> 00:09:20,510
I...

202
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:21,880
Yunxiao.

203
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:27,936
It's been so long.

204
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,850
Senior surely misses me.

205
00:09:31,870 --> 00:09:33,650
This time, I'll win him over.

206
00:09:36,150 --> 00:09:37,150
Don't go.

207
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,250
What?

208
00:09:39,510 --> 00:09:40,510
Don't go.

209
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,730
He's talking about me.

210
00:09:46,550 --> 00:09:48,130
Yunxiao, don't go.

211
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:51,490
Don't go, Yunxiao.

212
00:10:07,670 --> 00:10:08,730
Mentor.

213
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,650
Wait. What are you two doing here?

214
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:12,180
What do you mean?

215
00:10:13,030 --> 00:10:14,650
You trapped me here for so long

216
00:10:14,750 --> 00:10:16,526
and came back with no apology.

217
00:10:16,550 --> 00:10:17,550
You just hid here to nap.

218
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,340
Junior already came to save you.

219
00:10:25,150 --> 00:10:26,056
Junior?

220
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,730
You told her you were visiting kin.

221
00:10:28,910 --> 00:10:29,910
Visiting kin?

222
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:31,696
What relatives do you have?

223
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,700
Goat relatives in the mountains?

224
00:10:33,790 --> 00:10:35,530
Or monkey relatives?

225
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:37,336
Mentor, you've misunderstood.

226
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,366
Alright, stop making things up.

227
00:10:38,390 --> 00:10:39,550
I won't believe a word of it.

228
00:10:40,550 --> 00:10:41,910
I can't be bothered to spin tales.

229
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:01,700
You're lovesick, aren't you?

230
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,240
Mentor, what are you talking about?

231
00:11:05,270 --> 00:11:06,646
Don't explain. You're young.

232
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:08,056
I know all too well.

233
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:10,526
I just fear you'll make a mistake.

234
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:12,420
Haven't you blundered enough before?

235
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:18,300
No, Mentor.

236
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,366
No, don't, please don't.

237
00:11:19,390 --> 00:11:20,490
Don't pick up the whip.

238
00:11:41,910 --> 00:11:42,910
Flowers

239
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,340
can bloom again,

240
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,080
but youth

241
00:11:48,910 --> 00:11:50,300
never returns.

242
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,490
Cherish those around you.

243
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,320
Actually,

244
00:11:58,750 --> 00:12:00,340
I also once had

245
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,010
an unforgettable love.

246
00:12:05,750 --> 00:12:07,250
It wasn't in spring.

247
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,650
It was in late autumn.

248
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,080
She and I...

249
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:16,870
Changshou!

250
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:18,960
Changshou!

251
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:21,910
Changshou!

252
00:12:23,910 --> 00:12:25,486
The mood is at its peak.

253
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:27,100
Let me finish!

254
00:12:45,670 --> 00:12:46,670
It was

255
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:50,100
in late autumn.

256
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:55,580
[Hall of United Spirits]

257
00:12:57,510 --> 00:12:58,530
Disciple...

258
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:03,846
Mentor,

259
00:13:03,870 --> 00:13:04,890
I'm Qi Yuan.

260
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,886
Today, I vow to make Ascendance Sect my home.

261
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:08,060
I will cultivate the Way.

262
00:13:08,630 --> 00:13:10,110
[Wan Jiangyu] and guard here forever.

263
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,490
Good, good.

264
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:12,846
I'm Wan Jiangyu.

265
00:13:12,870 --> 00:13:14,526
I'll also make Ascendance Sect my home.

266
00:13:14,550 --> 00:13:16,820
I will cultivate the Way and guard here forever.

267
00:14:40,820 --> 00:14:44,860
[Jade Division]

268
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:50,960
What is this?

269
00:14:51,270 --> 00:14:53,070
Tomorrow, you'll go to the Training Assembly.

270
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,246
Your cultivation is still shallow.

271
00:14:54,270 --> 00:14:55,606
You may not beat those beasts.

272
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:57,060
So, I made this amulet.

273
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,130
It's the Training Assembly.

274
00:15:03,750 --> 00:15:04,976
Mentor sent us to train there.

275
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:06,296
How can you help me?

276
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:08,100
Even if I win, it would be unseemly.

277
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,480
I do not want it.

278
00:15:10,510 --> 00:15:11,530
How can you do that?

279
00:15:14,550 --> 00:15:15,770
How can you do that?

280
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:21,870
Do not worry.

281
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,060
I will win for sure.

282
00:15:26,150 --> 00:15:27,300
You fool.

283
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,360
Come on, come on.

284
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,600
Senior!

285
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:38,100
I'll win this time.

286
00:15:40,260 --> 00:15:42,486
[Tablets of past Ascendance Grand lords]

287
00:15:42,510 --> 00:15:45,060
May Junior Qi Yuan do us proud

288
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,560
and pass the Training Assembly.

289
00:15:47,150 --> 00:15:48,820
Senior.

290
00:15:50,510 --> 00:15:52,130
Qi Yuan! Qi Yuan!

291
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:53,510
Senior!

292
00:15:53,670 --> 00:15:54,670
Qi Yuan!

293
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:55,936
What happened?

294
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:56,846
Wasn't he at the Training Assembly?

295
00:15:56,870 --> 00:15:57,646
How was he injured?

296
00:15:57,670 --> 00:16:00,060
He had an accident there.

297
00:16:00,150 --> 00:16:01,766
His foundation is ruined.

298
00:16:01,790 --> 00:16:04,850
He has no hope of ascending to immortality.

299
00:16:06,630 --> 00:16:07,630
Qi Yuan.

300
00:16:08,150 --> 00:16:09,150
Senior,

301
00:16:11,550 --> 00:16:13,340
I let you down.

302
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,700
I let you down.

303
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,460
Senior.

304
00:16:38,670 --> 00:16:39,850
Junior Qi Yuan.

305
00:16:40,030 --> 00:16:41,130
After we part today,

306
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:42,940
we may never meet again?

307
00:16:43,910 --> 00:16:45,250
You are gifted,

308
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,730
a first-rate immortal seedling.

309
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:49,370
I once hoped to cultivate and ascend

310
00:16:49,790 --> 00:16:51,130
to immortality with you,

311
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:56,100
but now your foundation is ruined.

312
00:16:57,030 --> 00:16:58,310
That's made you an ordinary man.

313
00:16:59,030 --> 00:17:00,030
I...

314
00:17:01,630 --> 00:17:02,830
How could I bear such a thing?

315
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,936
Mentor and I have decided to leave

316
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:08,960
and search the world

317
00:17:09,750 --> 00:17:11,900
for herbs to mend your foundation.

318
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:17,640
Qi Yuan,

319
00:17:18,790 --> 00:17:19,790
wait for me.

320
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,570
I'll cure you.

321
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:30,677
Senior!

322
00:17:30,701 --> 00:17:32,416
[Jade Division]

323
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,440
Senior!

324
00:17:36,350 --> 00:17:37,700
Senior!

325
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:46,720
Senior.

326
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:52,400
Senior.

327
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:53,880
Senior.

328
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:01,920
Senior.

329
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:05,770
Senior.

330
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:58,240
Speak.

331
00:19:00,350 --> 00:19:01,416
I've figured it out.

332
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:03,656
Although this Tribulation is too showy,

333
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:04,976
the outside world doesn't know

334
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,620
the true Tribulation bearer is me.

335
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:09,416
But I know.

336
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:10,810
Except for you.

337
00:19:11,270 --> 00:19:12,490
In that case,

338
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:15,940
I just need to steer this a bit

339
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:18,806
and direct the bearer's identity elsewhere.

340
00:19:18,830 --> 00:19:21,046
That'll give me some room to maneuver.

341
00:19:21,070 --> 00:19:21,810
How about it?

342
00:19:22,030 --> 00:19:23,150
Who should you direct it to?

343
00:19:25,030 --> 00:19:26,220
This person

344
00:19:26,590 --> 00:19:28,420
must stay far from me.

345
00:19:29,070 --> 00:19:30,700
They can't be from Ascendance Sect.

346
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:34,090
How about...

347
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:38,216
How about I say it's an Elucidating Sect immortal

348
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:40,090
out for the Tribulation?

349
00:19:41,240 --> 00:19:42,240
Senior!

350
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:45,960
Senior!

351
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,006
What is it, Junior?

352
00:19:50,030 --> 00:19:51,030
Senior!

353
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:54,216
Senior!

354
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:56,246
Cloudlink Hermit from the Elucidating Sect is here.

355
00:19:56,270 --> 00:19:57,530
Mentor wants to see you.

356
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:58,880
The Elucidating Sect?

357
00:20:02,830 --> 00:20:04,350
When the Three Sages attained the Way,

358
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:07,380
the Primeval Lord of Heaven founded the Elucidating Sect.

359
00:20:07,830 --> 00:20:08,766
That sect

360
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:10,246
is very strict in taking disciples.

361
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:12,770
Only those truly blessed may enter.

362
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,440
Don't let the small number fool you.

363
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:16,420
They have Empyreal Aureate Immortals.

364
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:18,180
How are they so powerful?

365
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:21,810
They hand-pick immortal seedlings as disciples

366
00:20:22,270 --> 00:20:24,806
and then feed them spirit elixirs

367
00:20:24,830 --> 00:20:26,090
and treasure pearls.

368
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:27,440
And then...

369
00:20:27,550 --> 00:20:28,550
So...

370
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:30,700
That's basically cheating.

371
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:34,976
The Grandlord has arrived.

372
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:37,460
Greetings, Grandlord.

373
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:40,960
Sir,

374
00:20:41,750 --> 00:20:43,420
forgive me for not greeting you sooner.

375
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:45,706
I'm Cloudlink Hermit of Jadevoid Palace.

376
00:20:45,730 --> 00:20:46,647
[Cloudlink Hermit, Elucidating Sect]

377
00:20:46,671 --> 00:20:48,220
Nice to see you.

378
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:51,490
What brings you

379
00:20:51,550 --> 00:20:53,090
here today?

380
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:54,160
A few days ago,

381
00:20:54,590 --> 00:20:56,376
a cultivator underwent Divine-Demon Tribulation

382
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:58,246
in the South Sea.

383
00:20:58,270 --> 00:20:59,376
This man is said

384
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:00,866
to be called Changgeng - Why does he

385
00:21:00,890 --> 00:21:02,566
- of the Ascendance Sect.
- Only greet the Grandlord?

386
00:21:02,590 --> 00:21:04,536
The Divine-Demon Tribulation - That's perfectly normal.

387
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:06,626
- Hasn't appeared in a thousand years.
- The Elucidating Sect disciples.

388
00:21:06,650 --> 00:21:08,596
- This one must be gifted.
- Tend to be proud and aloof.

389
00:21:08,620 --> 00:21:11,150
My mentor doesn't want you - Only Aureate Immortals

390
00:21:11,420 --> 00:21:13,380
- to lead him astray.
- Worth their time.

391
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:16,220
So, I was sent to assess this man

392
00:21:16,590 --> 00:21:19,620
and see if he's worthy of our sect.

393
00:21:19,750 --> 00:21:22,420
Among all of our disciples,

394
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,900
none goes by the name Changgeng.

395
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:27,566
It must be rumors getting twisted

396
00:21:27,590 --> 00:21:28,700
along the way.

397
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:31,920
Detached Master,

398
00:21:32,030 --> 00:21:33,530
don't waste your tricks on me.

399
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:36,810
Your sect produces a talent like this once in a thousand years.

400
00:21:36,960 --> 00:21:38,176
You're afraid I'll poach him,

401
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:39,730
so you hid him,

402
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:41,000
right?

403
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:42,810
- We...
- Enough.

404
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,526
Since you've chosen to deceive me,

405
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:46,420
you think I'd still believe you?

406
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:49,376
You can't hide him forever.

407
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:50,620
If I can't find Changgeng,

408
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:52,770
I'll just stay here.

409
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:54,806
Go, prepare a good room for me.

410
00:21:54,830 --> 00:21:56,010
It must be clean.

411
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,976
If there's even a speck of dust,

412
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:59,810
I'll report to my mentor

413
00:22:00,030 --> 00:22:03,090
that you slighted an Elucidating Aureate Immortal

414
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:06,530
and have your sect shut down.

415
00:22:12,590 --> 00:22:14,900
Arrange a clean room for the cultivator.

416
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:17,290
Grandlord isn't even angry?

417
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:19,376
He's not even spitting blood?

418
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:20,400
Exactly.

419
00:22:21,550 --> 00:22:24,090
Westdawn Sect has already acted.

420
00:22:24,550 --> 00:22:27,050
The situation looks a bit troublesome.

421
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:28,290
But don't worry.

422
00:22:28,750 --> 00:22:30,526
I still have a backup plan.

423
00:22:30,550 --> 00:22:31,660
A backup plan?

424
00:22:32,110 --> 00:22:33,330
In this world of cultivation,

425
00:22:33,510 --> 00:22:36,810
there are Three Sects: Human, Elucidating, and Seizing.

426
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:39,380
Since the Human and Elucidating Sects won't work,

427
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:41,330
I just need to direct it

428
00:22:41,550 --> 00:22:42,980
toward the Seizing Sect.

429
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:44,200
Senior.

430
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:45,766
What is it?

431
00:22:45,790 --> 00:22:48,216
Zhao Gongming of the Seizing Sect is here.

432
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,490
Mentor wants us.

433
00:22:49,750 --> 00:22:50,810
The Seizing Sect?

434
00:22:53,240 --> 00:22:54,656
Got it. Go on ahead.

435
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:55,680
Sure!

436
00:23:00,960 --> 00:23:01,960
I'll hang up now.

437
00:23:03,310 --> 00:23:04,310
It's sour.

438
00:23:04,750 --> 00:23:05,750
It tastes pretty good.

439
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:07,400
Do you want some?

440
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,200
The Seizing Sect

441
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:13,700
is a lineage of Heaven reach Master.

442
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:15,176
They take everyone as disciples.

443
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:15,936
That means

444
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,726
all beings can walk the immortal path.

445
00:23:17,750 --> 00:23:18,810
Basically everyone.

446
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:19,896
Just look at them!

447
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:21,006
One after another,

448
00:23:21,030 --> 00:23:22,566
freaks and oddballs.

449
00:23:22,590 --> 00:23:23,630
What a bunch of half-wits.

450
00:23:25,590 --> 00:23:26,590
Listen, you two.

451
00:23:26,830 --> 00:23:28,216
Ascendance Sect is huge.

452
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:29,136
Don't go wandering off.

453
00:23:29,160 --> 00:23:30,290
Especially you, lass.

454
00:23:31,590 --> 00:23:32,590
The Grandlord is here.

455
00:23:33,590 --> 00:23:35,460
Grandlord.

456
00:23:38,240 --> 00:23:40,180
Sir,

457
00:23:40,310 --> 00:23:41,490
what brings you here?

458
00:23:42,400 --> 00:23:43,416
What was his name again?

459
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,180
What's he called?

460
00:23:44,240 --> 00:23:45,240
Detached Master.

461
00:23:46,070 --> 00:23:47,070
Old man.

462
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:48,160
You...

463
00:23:49,790 --> 00:23:52,570
I hear Changgeng here survived

464
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:55,380
the Divine-Demon Tribulation.

465
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,656
I came to make his acquaintance.

466
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:57,980
We'll have dealings later.

467
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:01,570
Among all of our disciples,

468
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:03,730
there is no Changgeng here.

469
00:24:03,830 --> 00:24:05,380
You must be too old to remember him.

470
00:24:06,400 --> 00:24:07,840
He and I are of the same generation.

471
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:10,810
Brat, why like an old man?

472
00:24:11,350 --> 00:24:12,350
You...

473
00:24:12,510 --> 00:24:13,510
How about this?

474
00:24:13,720 --> 00:24:14,730
We'll look for two days.

475
00:24:14,830 --> 00:24:15,830
If we find him,

476
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:16,936
we'll leave.

477
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:17,960
If we can't find him,

478
00:24:18,270 --> 00:24:19,330
we'll leave anyway.

479
00:24:19,590 --> 00:24:20,656
We'll stay here for two or three days.

480
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:22,006
Arrange some accommodations for us.

481
00:24:22,030 --> 00:24:23,180
There are so many of you.

482
00:24:23,240 --> 00:24:24,730
So, make sure the place is big.

483
00:24:24,790 --> 00:24:26,286
And food and drinks.

484
00:24:26,310 --> 00:24:27,380
Just handle it.

485
00:24:27,790 --> 00:24:28,790
Everyone,

486
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:31,136
let's eat and drink our fill here.

487
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:31,696
Okay?

488
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:33,416
Sure.

489
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,490
About the bill after...

490
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:36,660
Old man, write it down.

491
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:38,160
You're paying.

492
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:39,010
Let's go.

493
00:24:39,270 --> 00:24:40,270
Let's go.

494
00:24:44,750 --> 00:24:45,526
Grandlord.

495
00:24:45,550 --> 00:24:46,550
Grandlord.

496
00:24:48,310 --> 00:24:49,570
Now you know, right?

497
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:51,360
Grandlord coughs blood all the time.

498
00:24:52,830 --> 00:24:54,376
He never gets better.

499
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:55,456
Probably from anger.

500
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:58,570
All disciples, attention!

501
00:24:58,680 --> 00:24:59,856
Zhao Gongming is a man

502
00:24:59,880 --> 00:25:01,460
you must never cross.

503
00:25:01,590 --> 00:25:03,180
Mark my words.

504
00:25:04,030 --> 00:25:04,420
Yes.

505
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:08,380
Both the Elucidating and Seizing Sects are here.

506
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:12,180
If it were an ordinary man by now,

507
00:25:12,510 --> 00:25:15,006
he'd have no way out.

508
00:25:15,030 --> 00:25:16,220
You're a little rascal.

509
00:25:16,590 --> 00:25:17,700
You're no ordinary man.

510
00:25:19,480 --> 00:25:20,620
You understand me.

511
00:25:21,590 --> 00:25:23,010
Since this world is divided into...

512
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:26,440
Lan Ling'e?

513
00:25:27,790 --> 00:25:28,790
Lan Ling'e?

514
00:25:29,000 --> 00:25:30,000
Lan Ling'e?

515
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:34,086
Though

516
00:25:34,110 --> 00:25:35,290
there are Three Sects,

517
00:25:35,400 --> 00:25:37,900
not just Three Sects can face the Tribulation.

518
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:39,246
That's the blind spot.

519
00:25:39,270 --> 00:25:41,460
I just need to use it well

520
00:25:41,590 --> 00:25:44,570
and steer Changgeng to the East Sea.

521
00:25:55,590 --> 00:25:56,590
Senior.

522
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:57,920
Me again.

523
00:25:58,880 --> 00:25:59,900
When will this end?

524
00:26:01,750 --> 00:26:03,136
I'm Mermaid Princess Jiang Si'er,

525
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:04,616
leading the South Sea elites

526
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:06,290
to greet the elders of Ascendance Sect.

527
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:09,566
I heard Changgeng is here.

528
00:26:09,590 --> 00:26:11,420
Changgeng isn't a disciple here.

529
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:13,730
Princess, look elsewhere.

530
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:26,660
Please house our Mermaid Clan guests.

531
00:26:30,100 --> 00:26:33,340
[Hall of United Spirits]

532
00:27:00,680 --> 00:27:01,486
Lan Ling'e!

533
00:27:01,510 --> 00:27:02,510
I'm leaving.

534
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:04,286
Go on, hurry.

535
00:27:04,310 --> 00:27:04,766
Shut it tight.

536
00:27:04,790 --> 00:27:05,566
Keep it blocked.

537
00:27:05,590 --> 00:27:06,770
Don't let anyone in.

538
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:09,616
What are you doing?

539
00:27:09,640 --> 00:27:10,640
Mentor.

540
00:27:10,920 --> 00:27:12,806
Mentor, many have come outside.

541
00:27:12,830 --> 00:27:14,376
You must not open the gate.

542
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:15,770
Yes, so many people.

543
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:17,160
Nonsense.

544
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:20,940
We welcome immortal affinity.

545
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:22,720
If we shut our door

546
00:27:22,960 --> 00:27:24,420
when too many come,

547
00:27:24,590 --> 00:27:26,460
how do we take disciples?

548
00:27:26,920 --> 00:27:27,376
Open the gate.

549
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:29,176
But Mentor, this...

550
00:27:29,200 --> 00:27:30,250
Open the gate.

551
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:36,180
Deity!

552
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:42,460
Deity!

553
00:27:46,070 --> 00:27:47,070
Close the gate.

554
00:27:50,160 --> 00:27:51,160
Mentor,

555
00:27:51,310 --> 00:27:52,530
why?

556
00:27:53,960 --> 00:27:54,980
At this rate,

557
00:27:55,550 --> 00:27:56,620
we'll be overwhelmed.

558
00:27:57,510 --> 00:27:58,530
Oh, no!

559
00:27:58,790 --> 00:28:00,136
Please don't let Mentor find out

560
00:28:00,160 --> 00:28:01,160
I stayed out all night.

561
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:02,640
Move.

562
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:08,460
Come on, have a taste.

563
00:28:10,110 --> 00:28:12,526
Please keep things orderly and tidy.

564
00:28:12,550 --> 00:28:15,460
Be sure to stay safe and keep clean.

565
00:28:15,720 --> 00:28:17,090
Keep it clean, alright?

566
00:28:31,790 --> 00:28:32,790
Beautiful, isn't it?

567
00:28:33,660 --> 00:28:35,700
[I Was Here]

568
00:28:47,640 --> 00:28:49,010
Still hungover?

569
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:53,880
The Human Sect.

570
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:56,050
So amateurish.

571
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:06,240
Jiu.

572
00:29:07,070 --> 00:29:08,070
You're back.

573
00:29:10,830 --> 00:29:12,216
Wu, what are you up to?

574
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:13,486
Such a lovely day today.

575
00:29:13,510 --> 00:29:14,696
I just slept in.

576
00:29:14,720 --> 00:29:15,900
I was about to take a stroll.

577
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:19,250
You're getting better at acting.

578
00:29:19,510 --> 00:29:20,660
You were out

579
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:22,696
drinking all night, right?

580
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:23,490
Wu.

581
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:25,766
You mustn't tell Mentor.

582
00:29:25,790 --> 00:29:27,180
Or he'll punish me again.

583
00:29:27,400 --> 00:29:28,566
He made me do this

584
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:29,620
inside that circle

585
00:29:29,750 --> 00:29:30,656
and forbade me from drinking

586
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:31,380
or even moving a bit.

587
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:32,766
- It was terrifying.
- Alright.

588
00:29:32,790 --> 00:29:33,246
That man...

589
00:29:33,270 --> 00:29:33,806
Alright.

590
00:29:33,830 --> 00:29:34,830
Sit down first.

591
00:29:36,070 --> 00:29:37,140
Really frightening.

592
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:38,420
Come on.

593
00:29:38,590 --> 00:29:40,380
Here, have some tea.

594
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:43,050
To sober you up a bit.

595
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:45,490
I knew you treat me best.

596
00:29:46,590 --> 00:29:48,176
Mentor is busy with outside affairs today.

597
00:29:48,200 --> 00:29:49,840
He doesn't know you weren't in your room.

598
00:29:50,790 --> 00:29:52,090
That's good.

599
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:54,326
But your drinking causes trouble.

600
00:29:54,350 --> 00:29:55,856
What if you cause some serious calamity?

601
00:29:55,880 --> 00:29:56,766
Let alone me.

602
00:29:56,790 --> 00:29:58,456
Even Mentor couldn't save you.

603
00:29:58,480 --> 00:29:59,726
But I still have you.

604
00:29:59,750 --> 00:30:00,616
If not, I still have

605
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:02,140
all those seniors.

606
00:30:02,270 --> 00:30:03,050
Jiu,

607
00:30:03,160 --> 00:30:03,976
no matter what,

608
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,176
in the Ascendance Sect,

609
00:30:05,200 --> 00:30:06,380
you count as an elder.

610
00:30:06,590 --> 00:30:07,486
Since you are an elder,

611
00:30:07,510 --> 00:30:10,086
you should shoulder that duty.

612
00:30:10,110 --> 00:30:12,216
But I'm your junior.

613
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:13,046
Problems like these

614
00:30:13,070 --> 00:30:14,530
are for my seniors to solve.

615
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:16,136
As for me, I should be carefree,

616
00:30:16,160 --> 00:30:17,696
happy, easy, and at leisure.

617
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:18,566
Don't you agree?

618
00:30:18,590 --> 00:30:19,590
You...

619
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:22,140
I think you should go to Jade Division.

620
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:23,900
Jade Division suits your temper.

621
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:25,490
You really get it.

622
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:26,566
Do you know how good

623
00:30:26,590 --> 00:30:28,420
their wine is?

624
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:32,290
Those two at Jade Division...

625
00:30:33,030 --> 00:30:35,570
What immortal seedlings are they?

626
00:30:35,920 --> 00:30:37,856
As for Ling'e, she's so clever

627
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:38,900
and utterly adorable.

628
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:40,770
As for Changshou...

629
00:30:41,480 --> 00:30:43,940
That little frame looks so frail.

630
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:46,176
And he cannot touch girls.

631
00:30:46,200 --> 00:30:47,800
He can foam at the mouth with one touch.

632
00:30:47,880 --> 00:30:49,530
I wonder if he's cured by now.

633
00:30:50,030 --> 00:30:51,030
That sounds intense.

634
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:53,880
What is it, Wu?

635
00:30:55,590 --> 00:30:58,330
Qi Yuan called them immortal seedlings.

636
00:30:59,000 --> 00:30:59,976
He asked me

637
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:01,376
to look after them more.

638
00:31:01,400 --> 00:31:02,400
No problem.

639
00:31:02,550 --> 00:31:04,176
If anyone dares bully those two,

640
00:31:04,200 --> 00:31:05,760
I'll fly over and strike with my sword.

641
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:07,250
Alright, you win. Happy now?

642
00:31:07,590 --> 00:31:09,530
What I meant to say is

643
00:31:09,590 --> 00:31:11,006
I'd like to bring these two

644
00:31:11,030 --> 00:31:12,326
to our Griefbane Division.

645
00:31:12,350 --> 00:31:13,086
What do you think?

646
00:31:13,110 --> 00:31:14,136
I think it's a splendid idea.

647
00:31:14,160 --> 00:31:15,086
You fetch them,

648
00:31:15,110 --> 00:31:16,216
and I'll take charge of their discipline.

649
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:17,046
You? Discipline them?

650
00:31:17,070 --> 00:31:18,006
How ridiculous.

651
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:19,086
Yes, I'll do the disciplining.

652
00:31:19,110 --> 00:31:20,420
And I swear,

653
00:31:21,030 --> 00:31:22,570
I'm not just after their wine.

654
00:31:23,200 --> 00:31:23,976
Speaking of wine,

655
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:25,526
something just came to mind.

656
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:26,550
What?

657
00:31:27,030 --> 00:31:28,526
To punish you, Mentor

658
00:31:28,550 --> 00:31:29,526
ordered someone

659
00:31:29,550 --> 00:31:31,570
to go to your quarters

660
00:31:32,310 --> 00:31:33,620
and give away all your wine.

661
00:31:35,750 --> 00:31:38,376
I may have sinned greatly.

662
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:39,456
But it shouldn't go this far.

663
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:41,180
How can he give away my wine?

664
00:31:41,350 --> 00:31:42,656
Mentor, you white-haired old man!

665
00:31:42,680 --> 00:31:44,380
- You're so mean!
- I knew you'd say that.

666
00:31:47,750 --> 00:31:49,140
So,

667
00:31:49,830 --> 00:31:50,976
I hid a jar for you.

668
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:51,730
Where is it?

669
00:31:52,000 --> 00:31:53,000
In the backyard.

670
00:31:56,240 --> 00:31:58,460
That's more like it.

671
00:31:58,960 --> 00:31:59,960
I love you.

672
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:01,976
Remember: Don't let anyone see it.

673
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:03,770
Don't worry; It's fine.

674
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:05,680
Let me drink!

675
00:32:07,270 --> 00:32:08,330
Mentor!

676
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:12,216
Drinking again?

677
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:13,400
It has nothing to do with me.

678
00:32:22,830 --> 00:32:24,980
You're too cruel, Mentor.

679
00:32:25,460 --> 00:32:32,260
[Quarters for the Sea Deity Sect]

680
00:32:34,200 --> 00:32:35,200
Everyone.

681
00:32:41,830 --> 00:32:43,380
Since you're not cultivators,

682
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:45,240
you cannot enter Ascendance Sect.

683
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:48,490
The Grandlord, understanding your quest,

684
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:50,620
has specially prepared food and water for you.

685
00:32:51,750 --> 00:32:52,616
One serving of food per person.

686
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:53,766
Water is up ahead. Help yourselves.

687
00:32:53,790 --> 00:32:54,790
Great!

688
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,490
Hand these out to everyone.

689
00:33:00,110 --> 00:33:02,086
So, Changgeng the Great

690
00:33:02,110 --> 00:33:04,490
is renowned across the cultivation world.

691
00:33:04,830 --> 00:33:06,570
So many have come for his name.

692
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:09,140
How did I not know before?

693
00:33:09,310 --> 00:33:10,770
I was a frog in a well.

694
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:12,620
Of course, you knew nothing.

695
00:33:12,750 --> 00:33:13,900
It'd be odd if you did.

696
00:33:15,270 --> 00:33:16,700
Where did Senior Changshou go?

697
00:33:17,510 --> 00:33:20,050
He probably sought some quiet.

698
00:33:20,790 --> 00:33:21,790
I see.

699
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:23,860
Free from outside distractions,

700
00:33:23,920 --> 00:33:25,420
he stays true to his heart.

701
00:33:26,030 --> 00:33:28,570
Senior Changshou has taught me another lesson.

702
00:33:30,110 --> 00:33:31,110
Junior Ling'e.

703
00:33:31,350 --> 00:33:32,730
I'll return to cultivate first.

704
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,440
Alright.

705
00:33:37,680 --> 00:33:38,730
Ridiculous.

706
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:46,330
Today,

707
00:33:46,590 --> 00:33:47,806
I will tell you a story

708
00:33:47,830 --> 00:33:49,900
about a famous tale of our sect

709
00:33:50,790 --> 00:33:52,900
between the Sea Deity and the Dragon Maiden.

710
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:56,640
That day,

711
00:33:56,790 --> 00:33:57,830
the Sea Deity Changgeng...

712
00:33:57,960 --> 00:33:58,456
Changgeng?

713
00:33:58,480 --> 00:34:00,080
Was walking upon the surface of the sea.

714
00:34:00,260 --> 00:34:01,010
- My senior?
- Suddenly,

715
00:34:01,260 --> 00:34:02,176
in the distance, there was...

716
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:03,216
I won't listen! I won't listen!

717
00:34:03,240 --> 00:34:04,920
Senior could never be that kind of person.

718
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,200
Impossible!

719
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:07,176
Let me tell you.

720
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:11,650
That carp spirit had a truly captivating figure.

721
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:13,296
Sea Deity Changgeng

722
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:14,780
was burning with desire.

723
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:16,690
He tore off his clothes,

724
00:34:17,230 --> 00:34:20,460
revealing his muscular chest.

725
00:34:21,550 --> 00:34:22,736
This is not for children!

726
00:34:22,760 --> 00:34:23,780
I'm not listening!

727
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:30,840
Absolutely impossible.

728
00:34:31,000 --> 00:34:32,486
Senior is nothing but a toad in the pond.

729
00:34:32,510 --> 00:34:33,980
No one would ever be with him.

730
00:34:49,110 --> 00:34:51,776
Oh, heavens! Oh, earth!

731
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:53,530
Impossible!

732
00:35:03,880 --> 00:35:04,880
Blood again.

733
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:06,360
It's fine.

734
00:35:07,110 --> 00:35:07,900
I'm used to it.

735
00:35:08,070 --> 00:35:08,860
Mentor,

736
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,486
if I had your cultivation,

737
00:35:10,510 --> 00:35:11,830
I'd be throwing up every day too.

738
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:16,570
Our sect

739
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:19,940
hasn't been this lively in ages.

740
00:35:22,800 --> 00:35:24,690
Mentor, forgive my bluntness.

741
00:35:25,070 --> 00:35:27,166
The Three Sects have long been at odds.

742
00:35:27,190 --> 00:35:28,486
The Elucidating Sect is proud and arrogant.

743
00:35:28,510 --> 00:35:30,170
The Seizing Sect is in disarray.

744
00:35:31,360 --> 00:35:34,166
The Mermaid and Dragon Clans are linked.

745
00:35:34,190 --> 00:35:35,380
When they're all here,

746
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:38,126
I've been busy

747
00:35:38,150 --> 00:35:39,940
keeping order.

748
00:35:40,590 --> 00:35:41,590
Exactly.

749
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:44,320
The Three Sects have long been at odds.

750
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:47,380
Yet we all came from one root.

751
00:35:47,800 --> 00:35:50,050
And the Way we seek comes from one line.

752
00:35:51,150 --> 00:35:53,690
Why must we fight each other?

753
00:35:55,920 --> 00:35:57,690
I have a dream.

754
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:00,260
One day,

755
00:36:00,630 --> 00:36:03,490
the Three Sects will drop their rifts

756
00:36:04,110 --> 00:36:05,170
and gather under one roof

757
00:36:05,590 --> 00:36:06,776
to cultivate the Way together.

758
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:07,800
We'll even

759
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:10,090
be united.

760
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:15,090
That

761
00:36:16,590 --> 00:36:17,590
would be good,

762
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:19,000
but

763
00:36:19,670 --> 00:36:20,670
is it possible?

764
00:36:22,030 --> 00:36:23,860
This is my dream,

765
00:36:24,590 --> 00:36:25,590
yet all this time,

766
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:27,610
I've been at a loss.

767
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:29,800
But now,

768
00:36:30,590 --> 00:36:31,940
I see hope.

769
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:36,780
For the Three Sects to put aside old grudges,

770
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:40,170
they must face a common enemy.

771
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:43,130
A common enemy?

772
00:36:43,440 --> 00:36:44,440
I...

773
00:36:46,840 --> 00:36:48,166
Your cultivation is too weak

774
00:36:48,190 --> 00:36:49,900
to tell from the divination.

775
00:36:50,510 --> 00:36:51,570
I don't blame you.

776
00:36:54,630 --> 00:36:57,300
Our sect has a destined fate.

777
00:36:58,110 --> 00:36:59,550
A thousand years after its founding,

778
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:01,606
it will face a great calamity.

779
00:37:01,630 --> 00:37:02,630
A great calamity?

780
00:37:02,800 --> 00:37:03,800
What?

781
00:37:05,150 --> 00:37:06,690
Since the founding of our sect,

782
00:37:06,920 --> 00:37:08,400
it has been exactly a thousand years.

783
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:10,800
It's all right.

784
00:37:13,630 --> 00:37:15,050
When the great calamity comes,

785
00:37:15,110 --> 00:37:17,050
it will be hard for us

786
00:37:17,800 --> 00:37:19,420
to get through it alone.

787
00:37:19,710 --> 00:37:20,566
So, I had to let

788
00:37:20,590 --> 00:37:22,900
so many stay here.

789
00:37:23,840 --> 00:37:25,780
Someone faced Tribulation in the South Sea.

790
00:37:26,110 --> 00:37:27,300
Why did everyone

791
00:37:27,630 --> 00:37:29,780
end up here?

792
00:37:30,150 --> 00:37:31,150
Don't you think

793
00:37:31,920 --> 00:37:34,690
someone is setting this up?

794
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:36,820
Then,

795
00:37:37,320 --> 00:37:38,490
do you mean

796
00:37:39,030 --> 00:37:41,380
someone means harm to us?

797
00:37:43,590 --> 00:37:44,780
I can sense a new force

798
00:37:45,230 --> 00:37:47,530
rising beyond our walls,

799
00:37:48,760 --> 00:37:51,050
though I don't know which force it is

800
00:37:51,440 --> 00:37:53,170
or why it targets us.

801
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,646
But when the great calamity comes,

802
00:37:55,670 --> 00:37:57,170
faced with a fatal peril,

803
00:37:58,000 --> 00:38:00,650
I believe all the people present

804
00:38:01,230 --> 00:38:02,860
can surely set aside past differences

805
00:38:03,150 --> 00:38:04,380
and unite against the enemy.

806
00:38:04,920 --> 00:38:07,690
I'll use our destined calamity

807
00:38:08,360 --> 00:38:11,260
as the start of Three Sects' unity.

808
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:15,400
Mentor,

809
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:17,860
thanks for your guidance.

810
00:38:20,280 --> 00:38:21,690
Come on, it's your turn.

811
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:22,960
My turn.

812
00:38:27,230 --> 00:38:28,260
Ready?

813
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:29,760
Ready.

814
00:38:34,550 --> 00:38:35,550
Let's go.

815
00:38:46,920 --> 00:38:47,920
Sir.

816
00:38:48,230 --> 00:38:48,980
What's wrong?

817
00:38:49,070 --> 00:38:50,070
Nothing.

818
00:38:50,510 --> 00:38:51,510
Good, then.

819
00:38:52,840 --> 00:38:53,840
Wang Qi?

820
00:38:57,760 --> 00:39:00,130
There are many Wang Qis here.

821
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:08,090
Sir,

822
00:39:08,400 --> 00:39:09,736
which Wang Qi are you looking for?

823
00:39:09,760 --> 00:39:11,600
I'm looking for Wang Qi in Spiritkin Division.

824
00:39:11,920 --> 00:39:13,200
Wang Qi from Spiritkin Division?

825
00:39:15,590 --> 00:39:16,590
Is it accurate?

826
00:39:18,030 --> 00:39:19,170
Yes.

827
00:39:26,590 --> 00:39:27,590
Liu Sizhe.

828
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:34,210
Sir, what brings you here?

829
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,010
You are Liu Sizhe, right?

830
00:39:37,070 --> 00:39:38,070
Yes.

831
00:39:38,440 --> 00:39:39,560
Please bestow your guidance.

832
00:39:41,400 --> 00:39:42,606
Guidance is not mine to bestow.

833
00:39:42,630 --> 00:39:44,460
But if you insist, it's fine.

834
00:39:44,630 --> 00:39:45,856
Then I'll bestow first.

835
00:39:45,880 --> 00:39:46,900
After that, you can call.

836
00:39:47,590 --> 00:39:48,050
Bestowed.

837
00:39:48,190 --> 00:39:49,190
Call!

838
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:57,000
Seniors.

839
00:39:57,070 --> 00:39:58,260
What are you doing here?

840
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:00,800
Junior.

841
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:03,000
Junior.

842
00:40:06,670 --> 00:40:09,130
Zhao Gongming, he's not human.

843
00:40:09,630 --> 00:40:10,940
What happened?

844
00:40:12,800 --> 00:40:14,340
Oh, right, Junior.

845
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:15,980
Hurry to Jade Division! Save them!

846
00:40:28,630 --> 00:40:29,980
I'm here!

847
00:40:30,510 --> 00:40:31,780
Are you all waiting for me?

848
00:40:32,670 --> 00:40:33,670
Next.

849
00:40:34,550 --> 00:40:36,260
Li Changshou of Jade Division.

850
00:40:40,070 --> 00:40:41,130
Elucidating Sect.

851
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:42,840
Seizing Sect.

852
00:40:43,510 --> 00:40:44,530
Mermaid Clan.

853
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:46,380
Bear Stockade.

854
00:40:49,110 --> 00:40:50,980
Westdawn Sect's goal is clear.

855
00:40:51,320 --> 00:40:52,490
It's Changgeng.

856
00:40:53,840 --> 00:40:55,490
You still won't heed my plan.

857
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:58,130
Yunxiao.

858
00:40:58,280 --> 00:40:59,050
Don't worry.

859
00:40:59,150 --> 00:41:00,420
I won't force you.

860
00:41:01,550 --> 00:41:02,550
I trust you.

861
00:41:02,710 --> 00:41:03,820
You have your own plan.

862
00:41:04,590 --> 00:41:05,590
Thank you, Yunxiao.

863
00:41:06,400 --> 00:41:07,650
But you also promised me

864
00:41:08,150 --> 00:41:10,420
that you'd tell me every plan.

865
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:14,920
I'm waiting for someone.

866
00:41:15,230 --> 00:41:16,230
Waiting for someone?

867
00:41:16,630 --> 00:41:18,300
To break Westdawn Sect's plot,

868
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:19,416
the safest plan

869
00:41:19,440 --> 00:41:21,090
is still to send the Dragon Clan up

870
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:23,650
and let the Celestial Court step in.

871
00:41:23,760 --> 00:41:26,420
But the key figure

872
00:41:26,670 --> 00:41:27,740
is Ao Yi.

873
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:29,610
Yet the one he wants most to see

874
00:41:29,960 --> 00:41:31,380
is Changgeng.

875
00:41:31,960 --> 00:41:32,960
I see.

876
00:41:33,440 --> 00:41:34,486
So, Westdawn Sect spread the rumor

877
00:41:34,510 --> 00:41:36,086
that Changgeng was at Ascendance Sect.

878
00:41:36,110 --> 00:41:37,230
And it worked in your favor.

879
00:41:37,360 --> 00:41:39,400
You used it to bring Ao Yi here to Ascendance Sect.

880
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:42,050
Once he shows up,

881
00:41:42,400 --> 00:41:43,976
I'll let him be

882
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:45,606
the Tribulation bearer

883
00:41:45,630 --> 00:41:46,490
and help him build his name

884
00:41:46,550 --> 00:41:47,740
to lead the Dragon Clan.

885
00:41:48,110 --> 00:41:49,566
Then, he can go back to the Dragon Palace

886
00:41:49,590 --> 00:41:50,900
to take the throne

887
00:41:51,230 --> 00:41:52,336
and, in turn, root out

888
00:41:52,360 --> 00:41:54,336
the Westdawn members hidden there.

889
00:41:54,360 --> 00:41:55,690
Yunxiao, you are truly wise.

890
00:41:55,840 --> 00:41:56,920
You saw through it at once.

891
00:41:58,190 --> 00:41:59,530
So, that's your plan.

892
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:01,940
Very well, I'll help you.

893
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:03,050
Thank you, Yunxiao.

894
00:42:04,190 --> 00:42:04,980
For now,

895
00:42:05,110 --> 00:42:06,606
I only need to stay quiet

896
00:42:06,630 --> 00:42:08,340
here in Jade Division

897
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:10,530
and wait for Ao Yi to show up.

898
00:42:10,960 --> 00:42:12,130
But aren't you worried

899
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:14,420
that Westdawn Sect will find you first?

900
00:42:15,150 --> 00:42:16,150
Don't worry, Yunxiao.

901
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:17,856
I've made thorough preparations.

902
00:42:17,880 --> 00:42:19,256
I've withdrawn all paper butterflies.

903
00:42:19,280 --> 00:42:21,420
Even if Westdawn Sect has immense power,

904
00:42:21,670 --> 00:42:23,820
they'll never discover my location.

905
00:43:01,320 --> 00:43:07,100
♪ See mortal joys and sorrows ♪

906
00:43:07,770 --> 00:43:14,470
♪ Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds ♪

907
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:22,050
♪ Alas, love has many twists and turns ♪

908
00:43:22,680 --> 00:43:29,130
♪ Memories filled with sorrow ♪

909
00:43:29,870 --> 00:43:36,990
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

910
00:43:37,370 --> 00:43:44,270
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

911
00:43:44,650 --> 00:43:51,976
♪ Tearfully, this life's bond is not over ♪

912
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:59,170
♪ Past fragments vanish into night ♪

913
00:44:15,310 --> 00:44:20,480
♪ Down a few more cups of wine ♪

914
00:44:21,570 --> 00:44:28,590
♪ Through land and sea, I ask you to come ♪

915
00:44:29,780 --> 00:44:35,720
♪ For honor's sake, upright and grand ♪

916
00:44:36,420 --> 00:44:43,500
♪ Alas, our story is short ♪

917
00:44:43,840 --> 00:44:50,950
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

918
00:44:51,270 --> 00:44:57,750
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

919
00:44:58,530 --> 00:45:05,740
♪ Tears fall, this fate's not done ♪

920
00:45:06,130 --> 00:45:13,950
♪ Past fragments vanish into night ♪
